<title>USA: Transocean Offshore files $750 mln shelf.</title>
<headline>Transocean Offshore files $750 mln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transocean Offshore Inc. filed Thursday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration for up to $750 million in debt securities, preferred shares, warrants to purchase debt and common shares.</p>
<p>The Houston-based offshore drilling company said proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes including repaying outstanding debt.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf registration.</p>
</text>
